<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>For You 🤍</title>

<style>
*{
margin:0;
padding:0;
box-sizing:border-box;
font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
}

body{
height:100vh;
display:flex;
justify-content:center;
align-items:center;
background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff5f8,#ffe8f0,#fff);
overflow:hidden;
}

.card{
width:340px;
padding:35px;
background:white;
border-radius:25px;
text-align:center;
box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(255,170,190,.35);
animation:fade 1s;
}

h1{
color:#ff5c8d;
margin-bottom:20px;
}

p{
line-height:1.8;
color:#555;
}

button{
margin-top:25px;
padding:12px 28px;
border:none;
border-radius:30px;
background:#ff8fb3;
color:white;
font-size:16px;
cursor:pointer;
transition:.3s;
}

button:hover{
transform:scale(1.08);
}

#msg{
margin-top:20px;
font-size:18px;
color:#ff4f86;
font-weight:bold;
display:none;
}

@keyframes fade{
from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px);}
to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0);}
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="card">

<h1>I'm Sorry... 🤍</h1>

<p>
I know I hurt you.<br><br>

If I could turn back time,
I'd choose your smile over my mistakes every single time.<br><br>

I'm not perfect...
but my apology is real.
</p>

<button onclick="showMsg()">
Tap Me 🩷
</button>

<div id="msg">
🥹 Will you forgive me?
</div>

</div>

<script>
function showMsg(){
document.getElementById("msg").style.display="block";
}
</script>

</body>
</html>
